description = "A single unified skill for casting any spell, the magical counterpart of Basic Attack: one broad skill instead of a skill per spell. Very Hard difficulty, in the spirit of GURPS' Wildcard skills. Untrained it defaults to plain IQ, and training only ever helps from there."
